{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/122520-technocratic-pogram-as-a-vigil","id":122520,"title":"Technocratic Pogram as a Vigil?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-30T11:32:12-07:00","id":122520,"title":"Technocratic Pogram as a Vigil?","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">I\u2019ve seen some chatter about converting the cWoD\u2019s Technocracy to MtAw, and the handy Translation Guide does a fair job of setting direction. However, after reading the Vigil (especially TFV and The Cheiron Group), I got the idea of adapting the Technocracy into a Conspiracy (conceptually, the development catch phrase I\u2019m using is \u201cfourth-tier-mega-conspiracy\u201d). <br /> <br /> My initial thought was to dial down the gonzo (quite a bit) on MtAc and dial up the gonzo (a smidge) for HtV. Other than those broad (and somewhat nebulous) musings, I have no idea to where to start. I love the system for the nWoD, but I have no experience; any thoughts on where to begin?</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T11:43:17-07:00","id":122537,"title":"","content":"Perhaps, you could have the Compact &quot;Division 6&quot; from Witchfinders discover that they're being duped by a Seer in Panopticon, and join with a few rogue scientists from Null Mysteriis and Task Force Valkyrie to make a fully fledged Conspiracy.<br /> <br /> Perhaps combine the benefits and endowments from all three groups to make a tier 4 mega conspiracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T16:24:56-07:00","id":122749,"title":"","content":"If it's the style of game you're after, I'd just use the conspiracies already given. The Technocracy itself though kinda requires magi, or at least beings with that level of power; or a lot of hand-waving I guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T16:31:07-07:00","id":122753,"title":"","content":"Division Six in Witch Finders is a Compact that operates clandestinely within the US government, eliminating reality deviants to keep the fabric of reality whole. Sound familiar? Give them some of VALKYRIE's Endowments and you're set.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T19:29:24-07:00","id":122862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/122520-technocratic-pogram-as-a-vigil?p=122753#post122753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Division Six in Witch Finders is a Compact that operates clandestinely within the US government,</div> </div> </div> </div>Mmmmm... they <i>think</i> they operate as agents of the US government. Their members as a group aren't operating within the government infrastructure as a group(though as with any Compact, an individual member may be a government employee as their day job and use that to aid their Vigil).<br /> <br /> Personally, I broke the Seers association, but realized that their crazy ideology about Reality Deviance and cosmic superstructure, worked way better for Banishers than mortal Hunters - so I made Division VI a Banisher Cult. Same with the Keepers of the Source actually. And I made the Promethean Brotherhood a double-secret society within the Sword of Aegis Kai Doru.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-01T15:09:20-07:00","id":123445,"title":"","content":"What the OP is probably looking for would be better handled as an alliance of Compacts and Conspiracies. That is, don\u2019t try to map the Technocratic Union as a whole to a single Conspiracy; map individual Conventions, or possibly even Methodologies if they\u2019re unique enough, to separate Conspiracies (or possibly Compacts if they lack a compelling seed for an Endowment). Task Force Valkyrie\u2019s Advanced Armory is the sort of thing I\u2019d expect from Iteration X\u2019s Macrotechnicians; but it\u2019s nothing like what I\u2019d expect from the Syndicate\u2019s Financiers or just about any Progenitor Methodology. And so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}